# Generated device releases and MATLAB artifacts
_release/
**/results/
**/run_*/
slprj/
codegen/
*.asv
*.m~
*.autosave
*.mex*
*.fig

# Historical example data remain on disk but are not source-controlled.
Matlab_AND_ExampleData_lyp/**/*.csv
Matlab_AND_ExampleData_lyp/**/*.png
Matlab_AND_ExampleData_lyp/**/*.fig
Matlab_AND_ExampleData_lyp/**/*.mat
